From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Martinetti <luca@luca.io>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:51:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add cancellation for scheduled subagent jobs

A schedule could only be stopped by a human at /agents -> Scheduled jobs,
so a recurring "monitor X until it finishes" interval had no way to end
itself and the model that created it had no way to stop it.

- manage_schedule tool (list / cancel / pause / resume); cancel removes
  the job and aborts its in-flight run
- self-cancellation: recurring fires are told to end with the line
  [schedule-complete] once done, and the scheduler removes the job
- maxRuns and cancelOn auto-cancel; settled one-shots are removed
- subagents:rpc:schedules:list / cancel cross-extension RPCs
